      "description": "Algorithmic Vector Search & Retrieval Benchmarking Platform\nBuilt a vector search engine from scratch in Python/NumPy: exact search, IVF-Flat, PQ/IVF-PQ and HNSW, verified against a float64\noracle with 380+ tests.\nOn SIFT-100K, IVF-Flat hit 0.979 Recall@10 with ~9x fewer distance computations; IVF-PQ shrank the index 19.8x; HNSW reached\n0.973 recall checking ~5% of vectors.\nCut IVF build time from 1,095s to 23s by profiling k-means and moving distance assignment to BLAS, keeping the reference kernel as the\ncorrectness oracle.\nAdded filters, inserts/deletes and checksum-verified persistence; shipped a FastAPI + React lab (Docker, Render) with live recall/latency\ncomparison and semantic search.",
